<article class="env-lemma" id="01N9">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/01N9">Lemma <span data-tag="01N9">27.12.2</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a graded ring. Let $X = \text{Proj}(S)$. The open subscheme $U_ d \subset X$ (<a href="/tag/01N5" data-tag="01N5">27.12.0.1</a>) represents the functor $F_ d$ and the triple $(d, \mathcal{O}_{U_ d}(d), \psi ^ d)$ defined above is the universal family (see Schemes, Section <a href="/tag/01JF" data-tag="01JF">26.15</a>). </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
